WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.574
The fairies hurried back to the Wish Factory.

2
00:00:06.575 --> 00:00:10.038
"The wrong wish?" Blinx yelled.

3
00:00:10.039 --> 00:00:14.002
"And you call yourself a birthday fairy, Hob?"

4
00:00:14.003 --> 00:00:23.868
Hob hung his head.

5
00:00:23.869 --> 00:00:32.062
This time Blinx worked quickly.

6
00:00:32.063 --> 00:00:34.922
"Here's the wishbit," he snapped.

7
00:00:34.923 --> 00:00:39.323
"Don't come back again!"

8
00:00:39.324 --> 00:00:42.584
The fairies flew toward the picnic spot.

9
00:00:42.585 --> 00:00:47.721
Feather, Sprite, and Bumble flew ahead and whispered together.

10
00:00:47.722 --> 00:00:53.627
"They're mad at me," Hob thought.

11
00:00:53.628 --> 00:00:56.848
The three fairies landed on a log.

12
00:00:56.849 --> 00:01:00.722
Suddenly something moved nearby.

13
00:01:00.723 --> 00:01:04.151
"Watch out!" Hob cried.

14
00:01:04.152 --> 00:01:08.508
Shwoop! Bruce slapped his party hat over them.

15
00:01:08.509 --> 00:01:12.924
Bruce laughed. "You're trapped!"

16
00:01:12.925 --> 00:01:18.035
"Oh no!" Hob landed in a tree to think.

17
00:01:18.036 --> 00:01:19.883
What could he do?

18
00:01:19.884 --> 00:01:24.306
He was only good at sleeping and . . .

19
00:01:24.307 --> 00:01:29.628
"Drumming!" Hob thought. "Of course!"

20
00:01:29.629 --> 00:01:32.852
Hob pulled out his drumsticks.

21
00:01:32.853 --> 00:01:36.834
Zoom! Hob flew at Bruce's head.

22
00:01:36.835 --> 00:01:39.905
He banged his drum—right in Bruce's ear.

23
00:01:39.906 --> 00:01:41.638
Bong! Bang!

24
00:01:41.639 --> 00:01:48.289
"Ugh!" Bruce slapped his ear. "Another bug!" Bong!

25
00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:51.466
Bang! Boom! Bam! Hob

26
00:01:51.467 --> 00:01:54.422
hit the drum as hard as he could. "Ouch!"

27
00:01:54.423 --> 00:01:58.426
Bruce spun around and spotted Hob. "Stop

28
00:01:58.427 --> 00:02:01.425
it, you dumb fairy!" Hob

29
00:02:01.426 --> 00:02:06.011
kept banging the drum. Bruce

30
00:02:06.012 --> 00:02:12.155
kept slapping at his ear. Suddenly

31
00:02:12.156 --> 00:02:16.709
his other hand slipped, and— zoom!

32
00:02:16.710 --> 00:02:19.572
The three fairies escaped!

33
00:02:19.573 --> 00:02:25.836
"Grr!" Bruce growled as Hob flew away too.

34
00:02:25.837 --> 00:02:32.763
"Bruce!" Mark called, running over.

35
00:02:32.764 --> 00:02:35.207
"Have you seen my lucky cloth?

36
00:02:35.208 --> 00:02:37.641
It's for my trumpet."

37
00:02:37.642 --> 00:02:40.838
"What trumpet?" Bruce asked.

38
00:02:40.839 --> 00:02:46.121
"I wished for one for my birthday," Mark said.

39
00:02:46.122 --> 00:02:53.446
"Drop the wishbit, Hob!" Feather whispered.

40
00:02:53.447 --> 00:02:59.848
Hob let the wishbit flutter to the ground.

41
00:02:59.849 --> 00:03:05.349
"My cloth!" Mark cried. "And a trumpet!"

42
00:03:05.350 --> 00:03:09.662
"Your drumming saved us, Hob!" Bumble said.

43
00:03:09.663 --> 00:03:18.096
Hob grinned. "So you'll listen to my music now?"

44
00:03:18.097 --> 00:03:23.200
"Sure," Sprite said, and Bumble nodded.

45
00:03:23.201 --> 00:03:27.124
"Not me!" Feather said, flying off.

46
00:03:27.125 --> 00:03:39.137
"I'm going to make earplugs!"

